Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.61,0:00:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}Beyond the dawn, beyond the dawn{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.61,0:00:56.28,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}yoake no mukou yoake no mukou{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.28,0:01:01.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}There's so much I want to tell you{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.28,0:01:01.78,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}hanashitai koto takusan arun da{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.91,0:01:06.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}Filled with love, with love{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.91,0:01:06.58,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}ai kometa ai kometa{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.71,0:01:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}That can't be written down in a letter{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.71,0:01:12.50,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur4}{\i1}tegami ni kakikirenai omoi da{\i}
