Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mock? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.52,0:01:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always laughing and\Ndancing to a rhythm like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.37,0:01:53.67,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\fad(200,1500)}"Kuma's Life"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma's Life.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.96,0:01:56.17,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(628,724)}2 YEARS AGO
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bonnie, Bonnie, Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.50,0:02:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just Bonnie, Captain Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, Captain, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi is on that island.\NWhat? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As sure as I can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Problem is, the place is\Nswarming with marines right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mainland Vulcan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the body pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,HQ said that they're a priority target!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everywhere they go, they leave\Ninjured children and senior citizens!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.61,0:02:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're too scared to pick on\Nsomeone who can fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make these dirtbags pay! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:02:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.38,0:03:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on in, it's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big guy wearing black.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.02,0:03:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I just saw him\Non the edge of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.37,0:03:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been a Kumaji satin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.62,0:03:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the edge of town! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could explain, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't see each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why wasn't he there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't rush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.60,0:03:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates like us have all\Nthe time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to look for Nika, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, when I do find Dad, I\Ncan tell him I met his hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be so excited.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.21,0:03:56.75,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(296,554)}{\fad(300,0)}Meanwhile in
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.21,0:03:56.75,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1618,554)}{\fad(300,0)}the East Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.56,0:03:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, in the east blue...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The upstart pirate Straw Hat\NLuffy suddenly rose to prominence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after taking down Arlong and his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a real bounty!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.77,0:04:15.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1526,266)}"Straw Hat Luffy"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.56,0:04:15.64,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1647,266)}Luffy"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm headed out to Log Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want me to come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for the record,\Nwho is in charge there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be Captain Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinbei, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you guess how I know this pirate here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy is my little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.12,0:04:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid who beat the Arlong\NPirates is your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny how things work out, huh, Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of our children became pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the iron code that\Nall pirates must live by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plunder all treasure in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plunder! Treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only from bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.84,0:04:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But be nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm not an expert,\Nbut it looks good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.48,0:05:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I put some jewelry on my cheeks so\NDad can recognize me without my gems.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all that's left is to get famous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way he'll be able\Nto find me for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll find me. Right, Dad?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.96,0:05:25.46,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1358,526)}Egghead, \NNew World
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.94,0:05:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very unsettling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But these clones and your modifications\Nare going to change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And speaking of itch,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you hear about the pirate who\Ndeclared war on the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot down that flag. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.43,0:05:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boy is Dragon Son, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see my memories eventually, so\Nthere's no point in hiding it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.30,0:05:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What caught my attention is that Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fights for freedom with\Nthe power of rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sounds a lot like my hero. Nika.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.36,0:05:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.26,0:06:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Bomb: Giant Jet Show!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.92,0:06:10.59,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1660,978)}Thriller Bark, \NGrand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My orders are to annihilate\Nevery last one of you without
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exception but i will spare your\Nlives in exchange for the head of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat luffy the government\Nshould be satisfied with his life
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,alone you want us to betray our
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,captain not a chance what a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you want someone's head\Nfine i'll give you one but
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i can't let you have my\Ncaptains So take mine instead
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.28,0:06:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Luffy is the man\Nwho will become king of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pirates If you truly\Nwish to take his place
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be willing to\Naccept his agony yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This would be enough\Nto knock me unconscious
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.32,0:07:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He inspires such loyalty in his friends
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't be anyone's\Nson but yours, dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven warlords, report in immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refuse and lose your title.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awfully dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Preparations for the\Nexecution of Porcus D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a standard bearer\Nto the new generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's a son to Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We expect war.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A war with the Whitebeard pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.55,0:07:33.01,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1554,758)}Sabaody Archipelago
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the rest of the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it before I starve! Pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get more pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, I swear they're cooking as\Nfast as I can! Really? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't make a scene, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be the last\Ntime I see you, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've become quite the\Npirate, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate punched a celestial dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can someone attack a celestial dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole world knows that's forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.24,0:08:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to do it so close to\NNavy HQ, this is suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.72,0:08:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they trying to protect\Na fish man and a mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an unimaginable act of rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has even attempted such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand down, Pucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon... Eva...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for disappearing\Nwithout a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leave only two things behind as\Nproof that I existed in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lonnie, and the future of\Nthis boy, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, but this is how\Nharsh the new world will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:09:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your friends aren't ready\Nfor it You must grow stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when the time comes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday you'll save this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A self-destruct switch Do you\Nreally fear Kuma that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did turn him into a deadly\Nhuman weapon Did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're at the top of his authority ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if he goes berserk when we're out of\Ncommand range, who will stop him and how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cease your insolence,\Nyou paltry hired hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll do as you ask, but\Nplease let him keep some free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've invented a brain circuit that\Ncan toggle between personality modes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be easy to install,\NI promise you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave you a very clear order, Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy every trace of his free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're both men of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.28,0:10:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what will become of his daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What of Bonnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.24,0:11:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will never see her again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for trying, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't hear all of that, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out a scientist gave\Nme superhuman hearing.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.94,0:11:22.36,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Justice"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.68,0:11:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, today's the day\Nyou lose your free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only known you for two years,\Nbut we've had some good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.86,0:11:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems your first mission will be a large-scale\Nfight against the Whitebeard pilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Navy's requesting a\Nmassive deployment of clones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wouldn't mind, could you\Nprogram one more mission after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to guard the Strawhead's ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until one of his crewmates comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help them protect their home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish that I could watch\Ntheir journey to the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it that you expect from that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His actions move my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how else to put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.22,0:12:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a legend come to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Nika is just an old folk tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.24,0:12:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I told Bonnie that there's a warrior\Nwho moves to the rhythm of liberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and brings smiles to all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there really is a hero who\Ncan change the world like Nika?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.58,0:12:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it'll be Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A revolutionary betting on a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've chosen quite a dark horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a contradiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.28,0:12:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proof you're still human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, about that sample for my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had a deal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you push your memories\Ninto a paw like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you forget them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's like a copy, but it will\Nvanish after someone touches it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.72,0:12:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I devised a method to study it remotely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:12:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Purely clinical, I am a scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.72,0:13:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many people I've\Ntroubled through the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Troubled, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, to live is to trouble others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, what age\Ndid you become a slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was four.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the eldest here by four years, so\Nthat means it's my job to keep you fed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's sell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi! Kumachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:14:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm full!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm full!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm full!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.70,0:15:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.82,0:15:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always, always, love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.72,0:15:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll raise your daughter as my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.38,0:15:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.76,0:15:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those little jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:15:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were making fun\Nof my face rocks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could throw them at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess they are kind of ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm stuck with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.48,0:16:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your daughter has five\Nyears to live at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She would be beating the odds just\Nto make it to her 10th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your mother's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that means she's in heaven now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.06,0:16:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.42,0:16:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just have to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'd be better off dead, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warrior of liberation will\Nsave you. Have faith. He'll come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.72,0:16:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't lose anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mock?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean he'll come and free me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.24,0:17:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mass of pain and suffering\Nwon't just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, someone has to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never forget, those hands\Ncan do more than pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the hands of liberation!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.92,0:17:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can help Bonney get well,\Nthen I'll happily accept any fate.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.46,0:17:50.21,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Dad"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any fate at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika, the Sun God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.80,0:17:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll show up and deliver\Nus all to freedom one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll take you to the sea,\Nbeneath the free skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My disease will be all gone in a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I can finally go outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I pick you up, we'll take to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From there, it's an endless\Nhorizon. Can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go all kinds of places!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was young, I've had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone who could save the downtrodden\Nand free people from suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma-chi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.30,0:19:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma-chi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.34,0:19:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cure her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, you're home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.06,0:19:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.84,0:19:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, to live is to trouble others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:20:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your death will trouble\Neveryone who loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's proof of a life they lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tell you, Kuma, you are a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Bonnie's hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.88,0:20:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're everyone's hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.60,0:20:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too kind, Vang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.06,0:20:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.66,0:20:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mock?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean he'll\Ncome and free me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.10,0:20:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Vegapunk, for saving Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.68,0:21:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you pass on a message for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time you see her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy 10th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll be home to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.44,0:21:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should go to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can be my hair.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.76,0:21:37.06,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}I can't protect anyone again
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.76,0:21:37.06,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}mata daremo mamorenai no
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The voice of my voice is me.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.06,0:21:41.86,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}It's my fault that the voice is fading away
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.06,0:21:41.86,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}kiekakaru koe wa boku no sei
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long should I take my hand?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.86,0:21:44.15,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}I don't even have time to look down
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.86,0:21:44.15,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}utsumuku hima mo nai no
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see the next one.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.15,0:21:46.74,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Gravel marks on my palms
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.15,0:21:46.74,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}tenohira ni tsuku jari no ato
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.74,0:21:50.12,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Start moving again, my ship
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.74,0:21:50.12,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}mata ugokidase boku no fune yo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.86,0:21:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then move me.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.53,0:21:55.62,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Though I can't fly in the broad sky
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.53,0:21:55.62,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}hiroi sora wa tobenai kedo
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.62,0:22:01.50,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}I can light up the deep sea
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.62,0:22:01.50,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}fukai umi wa teraseru kara
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.63,0:22:02.46,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}bokura wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.63,0:22:02.46,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}We
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.55,0:22:04.96,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}EVERYDAY owarenai
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.55,0:22:04.96,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}EVERYDAY, can't let this be the end
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.96,0:22:07.59,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}EVERYDAY makerenai
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.96,0:22:07.59,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}EVERYDAY, can't be defeated
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.59,0:22:11.35,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}mamoru mono ga koko niwa aru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.59,0:22:11.35,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}We have something here to protect
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.39,0:22:13.89,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}yosou chigai kamo?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.39,0:22:13.89,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}This may not be what I expected
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.97,0:22:16.60,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}tomarenai yo mou
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.97,0:22:16.60,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}But we can't stop now
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.68,0:22:21.90,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}kodoku wo ima wakeai susumu
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.68,0:22:21.90,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}We go on, sharing loneliness
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.02,0:22:24.65,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}ojikedukuna yo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.02,0:22:24.65,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Don't be afraid
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.73,0:22:28.61,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}ano hi no boku to chigau kara
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.73,0:22:28.61,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}I'm not the same person I was that day
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.65,0:22:32.07,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}dare nimo jama dekinai yo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.65,0:22:32.07,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}No one can stand in my way
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.83,0:22:33.70,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}saa doite
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.83,0:22:33.70,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Now, move aside
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.74,0:22:36.29,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}sekai wo seishite mirai wo shinjite
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.74,0:22:36.29,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Conquer the world, believe in the future
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.41,0:22:38.87,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}ikutsu mono yoru kazoete
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.41,0:22:38.87,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Count up the nights
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.87,0:22:41.58,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}nani wo mite nani wo shitte
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.87,0:22:41.58,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}What did you see? What did you learn?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.58,0:22:44.59,ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}taisetsu na koto ni kiduita no
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.58,0:22:44.59,ED ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}To realize what was important

